"<div id=\"main\"><section class=\"wrap outcome-hero split\" data-hero><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Workforce compliance platform</p><h1 class=\"display outcome-title\">Manage compliance.<br><span class=\"text-blue\">Connect your<br>workforce records.</span></h1><p class=\"copy\">Give HR and compliance teams one place for role requirements, worker evidence and company records. Follow what needs review, what expires next and who has checked in on site.</p><a class=\"cta\" href=\"#demo\">Explore the platform ↗</a></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Connect the work around each person</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">One workforce record</p><div class=\"person\"><span class=\"avatar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">JT</span><div><p class=\"font-semibold\">Jamie Taylor</p><p class=\"text-xs text-slate\">Care assistant</p></div></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Role requirements</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">What the organisation needs</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Set</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Shared credentials</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">What the person supplies</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Review</span></div><div class=\"record-row\"><div><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Company records</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-slate\">What your team maintains</p></div><span class=\"badge \">Track</span></div><p class=\"mt-5 border-l-2 border-blue pl-4 text-sm\">Connect the evidence to your team’s next action.</p></div></div></figure></section><div class=\"wrap\"><section id=\"requirements\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">01 / Set the standard</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Define what each<br>role needs.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Start with the roles in your organisation. Set the evidence your team needs to collect and review, then connect each worker to those requirements.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Set role requirements in Certifyd</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><button data-open-screen class=\"block w-full text-left\"><img src=\"/images/connected/roles.png\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1144\" alt=\"Certifyd role setup with Nurse selected\" class=\"aspect-[16/10] w-full object-cover object-top\"><span class=\"link mt-3\">Open the full role setup screen ↗</span></button></div></figure></section><section id=\"records\" data-chapter class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"chapter-number\">02 / Give each record its place</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Connect personal evidence<br>and company records.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Workers hold personal qualifications and certificates. Your team maintains company records and reviews the evidence shared for work. Keep those responsibilities clear in one workforce view.</p></div><figure class=\"figure\"><div class=\"figure-head\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">Make ownership clear</span><img src=\"/images/connected/mark.svg\" alt=\"\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></div><div class=\"figure-body\"><div class=\"sheet\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Explore record ownership\"><button class=\"demo-choice\" data-owner=\"personal\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Person’s credentials</button><button class=\"demo-choice\" data-owner=\"company\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Company records</button></div><div class=\"mt-6 border-t border-line pt-5\"><p id=\"owner-label\" class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">Held by the person</p><h3 id=\"owner-title\" class=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-semibold\">Manual handling certificate</h3><p id=\"owner-copy\" class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-slate\">Jamie keeps this personal credential in the app and shares the evidence needed for work.</p><div class=\"mt-6 border-l-2 border-blue pl-4\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Your team’s responsibility</p><p id=\"owner-review\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm text-slate\">Review the shared evidence against the role’s requirements.</p></div></div><p id=\"owner-announcement\" role=\"status\" class=\"sr-only\"></p></div></div></figure></section><section id=\"capabilities\" class=\"chapter split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-blue\">03 / Put it to work</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Start with the task<br>your team needs to solve.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Use the same connected records to bring people in, review evidence, track dates and follow attendance.</p></div><div class=\"divide-y divide-line border-y border-line\"><a class=\"solution-row\" href=\"/outcomes/reduce-compliance-risk/\"><span><strong>Close compliance gaps</strong><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-slate\">Find missing evidence and follow the review.</span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"solution-row\" href=\"/outcomes/import-compliance-records/\"><span><strong>Bring your records across</strong><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-slate\">Start with the worker spreadsheet you already use.</span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"solution-row\" href=\"/outcomes/reduce-compliance-admin/\"><span><strong>Reduce the daily chasing</strong><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-slate\">Keep requests, reviews and renewals in view.</span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"solution-row\" href=\"/outcomes/verified-worker-check-in/\"><span><strong>Follow site attendance</strong><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-slate\">See who checked in, where and when.</span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><a class=\"solution-row\" href=\"/outcomes/portable-worker-credentials/\"><span><strong>Give people their own record</strong><span class=\"mt-1 block text-sm text-slate\">Connect personal credentials to company requirements.</span></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a></div></section><section class=\"split py-16\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><h2 class=\"heading\">Review the details<br>before you decide.</h2><p class=\"copy\">Explore how Certifyd fits your organisation’s requirements and the people who manage them.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-3\"><a class=\"link\" href=\"/security/\">Review security and data protection ↗</a><a class=\"link\" href=\"/platform/records/\">Explore expiry and review dates ↗</a><a class=\"link\" href=\"/industries/care/\">Explore care workforce requirements ↗</a></div></section></div><section id=\"demo\" class=\"bg-ink py-16 text-white md:py-20\"><div class=\"wrap split\"><div class=\"chapter-copy\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-[#93BBFF]\">Bring your workflow</p><h2 class=\"heading\">Bring your team’s workflow.<br>See how it connects.</h2></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-start gap-6\"><p class=\"max-w-[43ch] text-lg text-white/80\">Show us a role, the records you manage and a task you want to improve. We’ll walk through the company view and the worker’s contribution.</p><a class=\"cta bg-white text-ink hover:bg-sky\" href=\"https://cal.com/andrew-speer/certifyd-discovery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Book a platform demo <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><p class=\"text-sm text-white/75\">A 20-minute conversation with the Certifyd team.</p></div></div></section></div><dialog id=\"screen-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"screen-title\" class=\"m-auto max-h-[94dvh] w-[min(96vw,90rem)] overflow-auto rounded-sm border border-line bg-white p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-5\"><h2 id=\"screen-title\" class=\"text-xl font-semibold\">Set the requirements for each role</h2><button autofocus data-close class=\"cta\">Close</button></div><img src=\"/images/connected/roles.png\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1144\" alt=\"Certifyd role selection screen showing Nurse selected\" class=\"h-auto w-full\"></dialog>"
